# Retained Playwright/CDP prior art, kept on disk and out of the index. It is not the
# product: the supported surface is the Swift/WKWebView server, which deliberately
# exposes no JavaScript or CDP tool. Tracking these files made the repository contradict
# that claim in public, on the one point the product is sold on.
# scripts/verify-installed-native.mjs is NOT here: it uses only Node built-ins and
# scripts/verify-native-installed.sh runs it as part of the install gate.
